    "file": "ledger.md",
    "content": "# Nimbus Ledger\n\n*Product documentation, updated 2026-06-30*\n\nNimbus Ledger meters usage and produces invoices for usage-based pricing.\n\n## Features\n\n- Usage metering from events or from a CSV import\n- Rating rules: tiers, volume discounts, minimum commitments\n- Invoice generation and dunning\n- Federated login (SAML 2.0) in every tier\n\n## Pricing\n\nPrices are per month on an annual plan, plus 0.5% of invoiced volume.\n\n|  | Starter | Pro | Enterprise |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Price | $49 | $199 | Custom |\n| Invoiced volume included | $50,000 | $500,000 | Custom |\n| Federated login (SAML 2.0) | Yes | Yes | Yes |\n| Dunning | No | Yes | Yes |\n| Support plan | Community | Standard | Premium |\n\n## Integrations\n\n| Integration | Minimum Ledger version | Partner requirement |\n|---|---|---|\n| Stripe | 2.4 | Stripe API 2024-06-20 or later |\n| NetSuite | 2.5, Enterprise only | NetSuite SuiteTalk REST |\n| Salesforce | Listed as \"coming soon\" in the 2.6 roadmap | Not yet published |\n\n## Support SLA\n\nResponse time to first human reply.\n\n| Priority | Starter | Pro | Enterprise |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| P1 (service down) | 8 business hours | 2 hours | 30 minutes, 24x7 |\n| P2 (degraded) | Next business day | 8 hours | 2 hours |\n| P3 (question) | 3 business days | 2 business days | 1 business day |\n| P4 (feature request) | Best effort | Best effort | Best effort |\n"
