    "file": "support-policy.md",
    "content": "# NimbusStack support policy\n\n*Company-wide document, updated 2026-04-01*\n\n## Priority definitions\n\n- **P1:** the service is down or unusable for all users of a workspace.\n- **P2:** a core feature is degraded or unavailable for some users, with a workaround.\n- **P3:** a question, or a minor defect with no operational impact.\n- **P4:** a feature request.\n\n## Business hours\n\nBusiness hours are 08:00 to 18:00 in the customer's contracted time zone, Monday to Friday, excluding public holidays in that jurisdiction. Where an SLA says \"24x7\", the clock runs continuously.\n\n## Support plans\n\nEach product's pricing table names the support plan for each tier. Response times are in each product's own SLA table; they differ by product.\n"
